SUMMARY:The Amazing Trailmen Games (Open House - Join the Adventure)
DESCRIPTION:The Amazing Trailmen Games (August 10th)\n\nActivities:\n- Pugil Sticks: A competitive sparring challenge.\n- Slingshot Station: A precision target challenge using candy ammo.\n- "Skeeball" Cornhole: Nine boards arranged in three rows\, with points increasing based on throwing distance.\n- Tug-o-War: A collective team-building event for all ages and fathers.\n- Refreshments: Red\, white\, and blue Bomb Pops.\n\nNon-member guests allowed. Uniform required. Medical form not required.
LOCATION:St. Michael the Archangel Catholic Church\, 490 Arnold Mill Rd.\, Woodstock\, GA 30188
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
